  "body": "With an incredible amount of outdoor space and room for just about every backyard activity you can imagine, the outdoor setting is a huge part of the appeal here. Add an attractive single level weatherboard home, extensive entertaining areas and a fantastic layout for families, and there's plenty to get excited about.\r\n\r\nA spacious open plan kitchen, living and dining area provides an abundance of space, with a large kitchen featuring an oversized island, gas cooktop and dual ovens. An additional lounge offers another place to relax, with large stacker doors connecting both living areas to the extensive wraparound deck, complete with a covered louvre entertaining area overlooking the enormous lawn. Five double bedrooms provide plenty of space for the whole family, including a light filled master suite with direct deck access, a walk in wardrobe and fully tiled ensuite, alongside a fully tiled family bathroom. With so much room to enjoy both indoors and out, there's plenty here for the whole family to love.\r\n\r\n* Attractive single level weatherboard construction\r\n* Established gardens and palms adding to the street appeal\r\n* Expansive open plan kitchen, living and dining\r\n* Oversized kitchen with large island, gas cooktop and dual ovens\r\n* Two spacious living areas, both opening outdoors\r\n* Extensive wraparound decking for entertaining\r\n* Covered louvre area for year round outdoor enjoyment\r\n* An enormous backyard with room for the kids and pets\r\n* Master suite with walk in wardrobe, ensuite and direct deck access\r\n* Double internal access garage plus ample off street parking\r\n\r\nOrewa continues to be a popular choice for families, with its beautiful beach, local schools, cafés, shops and excellent amenities all within easy reach. With so much on offer both at home and in the surrounding area, this property is well worth your attention. Contact us today to arrange a viewing or come along to the next open home.\r\n\r\nFor more information, please download the files within the link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/UB1E",
